{"type":"text","timestamp":1787837208280,"sessionID":"ses_fbc9a232dffeeY05uy5T45HdZm","part":{"id":"prt_04366be5a001K9o0XlVPTiJEWj","sessionID":"ses_fbc9a232dffeeY05uy5T45HdZm","messageID":"msg_04366477e0014QwJ5SQi65Di6N","type":"text","text":"Now I understand the setup. The project uses Next.js 16 with the `@/*` path alias. Since `getPosts()` doesn't use `fetch`, the right modern caching approach for time-based + tag-based invalidation is `unstable_cache` from `next/cache` (1 hour = 3600 seconds).","time":{"start":1787837208279,"end":1787837208279}}}
